flowchart LR
    browser[Next.js operations dashboard]
    api[FastAPI API\norganisation-scoped routes]
    queue[(Redis queue)]
    worker[Dramatiq worker\nworkflow runtime]
    db[(Postgres\nSQLite local mode)]
    trace[(Runs, traces, approvals,\naudit and usage records)]
    sandbox[Deterministic sandbox\nLLM + connector adapters]
    future[Optional live adapters\nOpenAI / Anthropic / Gmail / CRM]

    browser -->|read, approve, replay| api
    api -->|record event first| db
    api -->|enqueue long-running work| queue
    queue --> worker
    worker -->|load immutable workflow version| db
    worker -->|typed steps and policy checks| sandbox
    sandbox -->|structured outputs and simulated actions| worker
    worker -->|ordered trace + cost + audit| trace
    trace --> db
    api -->|run viewer and approval inbox| trace
    sandbox -. configured separately .-> future

    subgraph EventFlow[Durable event flow]
        event[Incoming event] --> idempotency[Unique organisation + idempotency key]
        idempotency --> dispatch[Workflow dispatch]
        dispatch --> checkpoint[Checkpointed step execution]
        checkpoint --> approval{External or destructive action?}
        approval -->|no| continue[Continue automatically]
        approval -->|yes| wait[WAITING_FOR_APPROVAL]
        wait --> decision[Approve, edit or reject]
        decision --> continue
        continue --> complete[SUCCEEDED / FAILED / REJECTED]
    end

    api --> event
    complete --> trace
